{
  "repo": "EH3D-ROUTEPRO",
  "ecosystem": "eh3d",
  "tagline": "The routing (milling) workflow of a classic DOS program for Bungard CCD machines, in Rust.",
  "description": "EH3D-ROUTEPRO reads HP-GL plot files, the tool table and the machine file, plans multi-pass milling paths and runs them through the classic or modern text-mode screens of EH3D-DRILLPRO, whose protocol, screens and languages it reuses. The job goes to a simulator, to the serial port or a USB adapter, to the EH3D-NODE-BUNGARD node or to EH3D-SERVER. Everything is tested on a computer; no routing job has run on a real machine.",
  "columns": [
    "WHO USES IT",
    "THIS REPOSITORY",
    "WHERE THE JOB GOES"
  ],
